      "en": "But I know your sitting down, your going out, your coming in, and your raging against me.",
      "ko": "네 거처와 네 출입과 나를 거스려 분노함을 내가 아노라",
      "source_text_hash": "9e2858945d4f20faa9b7c622e86adc9bfc0d58507531a57c7bc5025a47b42f44",
      "translation_text_hash": "f3d338abc4684cb8e10b486b7fe0a847626dfc91a2e8e8477bdbade984d30b6d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네 거처와 네 출입과 나를 거스려 분노함을 내가 아노라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f3d338abc4684cb8e10b486b7fe0a847626dfc91a2e8e8477bdbade984d30b6d"
      ]
