      "en": "Then the LORD’s angel went out and struck one hundred and eighty-five thousand men in the camp of the Assyrians. When men arose early in the morning, behold, these were all dead bodies.",
      "ko": "여호와의 사자가 나가서 앗수르 진중에서 십 팔만 오천인을 쳤으므로 아침에 일찌기 일어나 본즉 시체 뿐이라",
      "source_text_hash": "6539056249d4ed99e16a4b95cedf6635e100e5433878540c72052b33cbc660bc",
      "translation_text_hash": "04e15e7dd97b4a81a4ad403d485c6a9528f9ba2ad90b2c415506b027dac9f4ad",
